# WFORMTJ.KEY - Cancel with changes answered No, then OK; the first bad
# field of OK; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTJ.SNP.
K F5
T Q
K STAB STAB
S ONCANCEL
K ENTER
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
K STAB
S ONOK
# COND is XX, no word of its choices: OK stops there.
K ENTER
S BADCOND
K DOWN ENTER
S SAVED
# The values stay: TEXT is Q. Emptied, TEXT is required.
K F5
K HOME SHIFT-END DEL ENTER
S REQ
K ESC
S ASK2
K N
S KEPT2
T W
K ENTER
S DONE
